1
00:00:00,538 --> 00:00:02,208
(Scene:)- Leonard.
- What?

2
00:00:02,373 --> 00:00:05,583
- My mom bought me those pants.
- I'm sorry.

3
00:00:06,210 --> 00:00:08,250
You're gonna have to call her.

4
00:00:10,756 --> 00:00:13,676
Sheldon, I am so sorry
I dragged you through this.

5
00:00:13,843 --> 00:00:18,093
(Sheldon:)It's okay. It wasn't my first pantsing
and it won't be my last.

6
00:00:18,264 --> 00:00:19,934
(Leonard:)And you were right about my motives.

7
00:00:20,099 --> 00:00:22,849
(Leonard:)I was hoping to establish
a relationship with Penny...

8
00:00:23,019 --> 00:00:26,269
...that might have someday led to sex.

9
00:00:26,856 --> 00:00:29,356
SHELDON:
Well, you got me out of my pants.

10
00:00:30,776 --> 00:00:34,276
(Leonard:)Anyway, I've learned my lesson.
She's out of my league, I'm done with her.

11
00:00:34,447 --> 00:00:35,617
(Leonard:)I've got my work.

12
00:00:35,781 --> 00:00:38,741
(Leonard:)One day I'll win the Nobel Prize
and then I'll die alone.

13
00:00:38,910 --> 00:00:41,950
(Sheldon:)Don't think like that.
You're not going to die alone.

14
00:00:42,121 --> 00:00:45,121
(Leonard:)Thank you, Sheldon.
You're a good friend.

15
00:00:46,250 --> 00:00:49,130
SHELDON: And you're certainly
not gonna win a Nobel Prize.

16
00:00:49,670 --> 00:00:53,470
This is one of my favorite places
to kick back after a quest.

17
00:00:53,633 --> 00:00:55,463
(Howard:)They have a great house ale.

18
00:00:55,635 --> 00:00:56,635
PENNY:
Wow, cool tiger.

19
00:00:56,802 --> 00:01:00,022
Yeah, I've had him since Level 10.

